{
  "abstract": "Lean formalizations of eight structural results of Chen and Shan on graph completion and decomposition. They cover robust realization of degree sequences, regular auxiliary completion, tripartite absorption and fractional and approximate triangle decomposition, bounded signed edge weights in dense bipartite graphs, and retention of prescribed edges in a perfect matching.",
